        <footnote id="F7">1/34 of GSUs shall vest on the 25th of the month of the Grant Date, vesting 1/34 every 1 month(s) for 9 event(s); 1/34 of GSUs shall vest on the 1st of the month 9 month(s) after the Grant Date, vesting 1/34 every 1 month(s) for 25 event(s), subject to continued employment on such vesting date(s).</footnote>
